Maniac's ascension guide has some discussion of this subject. When I
started playing Nethack, I would go to mine town as soon as I found
the mines, do Sokoban, get the luckstone from Mine's End, and explore
up to Medusa until I could enter the quest.

Since then, my plan typically has become more flexible. Pacifists
visit the Oracle first. Speed games dig down to mine town, dig for the
luckstone, and return by (uncontrolled) level teleportation. In normal
games, I take what falls in my lap - no fixed travel plan.

